Description: dkms source for the CIX Sky1 Zhouyi V3 NPU driver
 Kernel driver (aipu) for the Zhouyi V3 NPU of the CIX Sky1 / P1 SoC,
 derived from CIX's 6.2.0-1 release. Builds on 6.6.x-cix and 7.0 kernels.
